date-released: 2026-05-21

license: MIT

repository-code: https://github.com/unlv-evol/PatchPrompt

abstract: >-
  Replication package for the PatchPrompt empirical software engineering study.
  The package includes raw PatchTrack artifacts, ChatGPT conversation PDFs,
  human and LLM-based prompt annotations, downstream modeling datasets,
  descriptive statistics, stage-based quantitative analyses, robustness and
  sensitivity analyses, qualitative evidence artifacts, diagnostics, notebooks,
  and artifact-evaluation materials supporting end-to-end reproducibility of the
  study findings.
